<p> </p>

<p style="line-height:1.6;">Open NJ allows faculty and students to find Open Educational Resources (OER) adopted at participating New Jersey institutions. By creating this common space, Open NJ enables faculty to share OER, expand their knowledge of adopted OER, and identify OER for their potential adoption. ( <a href="<%BASEURL%>info/aboutopennj">learn more</a> <!--<a href="<%BASEURL%>browseby">browse by metadata</a>--> )</p>


